// TelemetryDeck setup (optional — app runs fine without analytics)
//
// 1. Create an app at https://telemetrydeck.com and copy the App ID.
// 2. Production (TestFlight / App Store): set TelemetryDeckAppID in Info.plist at repo root.
//    Local-only override: TELEMETRYDECK_APP_ID in the Xcode Run scheme.
//
// Signals appear in the TelemetryDeck dashboard within a few minutes.
